  "content": "<span>Are Office Hours Pointless?</span>\n\n            <div class=\"field field--name-field-featured-image field--type-entity-reference field--label-hidden field__item\">  <img alt=\"A Post-it like note with a paper clip says &quot;Office Hours.&quot;\" height=\"1481\" src=\"https://www.insidehighered.com/sites/default/files/2026-08/GettyImages-1389757990.jpg\" width=\"2023\" />\n\n</div>\n      \n<span><span>Elizabeth Redden</span></span>\n\n<span><time datetime=\"2026-08-26T03:00:00-04:00\" title=\"Wednesday, August 26, 2026 - 03:00 AM\">Wed, 08/26/2026 - 03:00 AM</time>\n</span>\n<p>We think they still hold value, but we need to adapt.</p>\n  <div class=\"field field--name-field-authors field--type-entity-reference field--label-inline clearfix\">\n    <div class=\"field__label\">Byline(s)</div>\n          <div class=\"field__items\">\n              <div class=\"field__item\"><a href=\"https://www.insidehighered.com/author/tim-franz\" hreflang=\"en\">Tim Franz </a></div>\n          <div class=\"field__item\"><a href=\"https://www.insidehighered.com/author/lauren-vicker\" hreflang=\"en\"> Lauren Vicker </a></div>\n              </div>\n      </div>",
